y/HttpToolGateway 134 LOC, CheckpointStore + both checkpointers 84 LOC, Budgets 54 LOC) but grep finds zero references outside ","dependency_health":"Dependency set is small and cohesive: 21 workspace members, 22 external deps declared once in [workspace.dependencies] (Cargo.toml:32-59), 367 packages in Cargo.lock for ~12.7k LOC; one async runtime ","low_level_elegance":"Function bodies are consistently short and guard-clause driven: `let Some(c) = &self.0 else { return dry_run(args); };` opens twelve executors (crates/tool-server/src/executors/mod.rs:88-303), `let So","mid_level_elegance":"The message contract itself is centralized: agent-protocol defines Envelope, ToolCall, Decision, ToolResult, HandoffPayload and the ares.* subject constants (crates/agent-protocol/src/lib.rs:12-23), a","test_strategy":"68 test functions across 13,894 LOC in 63 Rust files; only 19 of 63 files contain a #[cfg(test)] module (53.6% of LOC lives in tested files, but the untested remainder includes every service binary).","api_surface_coherence":"Three error-body conventions coexist in one axum service: `Result<Json<Value>, (StatusCode, String)>` (crates/api-server/src/main.rs:111,132,156,167,185,202,258; vulns.rs:49,80,98,114,133; playbooks.r","authorization_consistency":"crates/api-server/src/main.rs:283-325 registers 27 routes; the only layers applied are http_limits::middleware and CorsLayer::permissive() (main.rs:361-367) \u2014 no authn/authz middleware exists, and mai","ai_generated_debt":"No nosy logging: only 5 `debug!` calls in the whole workspace (enrichment-lib:237,441; llm-client/anthropic.rs:128; ingestion-gateway/pollers.rs:54,92) and no entry/exit logging; `info!`/`warn!` sit a","incomplete_migration":"Most smaller migrations are finished and the old path is gone, not aliased: every axum route uses 0.8 `{param}` syntax (crates/api-server/src/main.rs:283-325, with a guard test at main.rs:386 that bui","package_organization":"Crate granularity is deliberate and documented